<title>USA: Comdisco unit taking on new name.</title>
<headline>Comdisco unit taking on new name.</headline>
<dateline>ROSEMONT, Ill. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comdisco Inc, a technology services company, said its Comdisco Disaster Recovery Services division is changing its name to Comdisco Continuity Services, effective immediately.</p>
<p>It said the name more closely reflects the company's range of services.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
